//e2e dbgm_readline_eof: EOF on the command channel while the program is
//parked in io.readline ends the whole session (exit 0) — the channel is
//the session's lifeline, the same rule as EOF while frozen. main returns
//7 so the exit code discriminates: only the hard exit produces 0, a
//regression that fed an empty line instead would finish main and exit 7.
import io;
int main() {
    string s = io.readLine();
    return 7;
}
